// TEST: Choice Operand Stays Deferred (rejects)
// BORROW (2026-11-23): now refused at the write (BL4005, formalism 10.2): an uncomputed value
// over the written storage is still used after it. The text below is the schedule it witnessed (gap G213).
// Gap G213 (round 4 wave 8): the choice c = d <|> x is stored by the fold
// over it, but its operand d is evaluated as a copy: d stays deferred, so the
// read z after the write to x evaluates d over the written x.
